Not bad for the price. Sure it is old and has its share of problems&#44; but the price is nice. Spoke to the manager this morning about a problem with our neighbor. She was very nice and assured me that she would take care of everything. 
&lt;(UPDATE)&gt;
We just had run of the mill bad nieghbors&#44; no guns or lazy boys. Could happen anywhere. The other nieghbors are all great. The Manager&#44; Jennifer was very nice professional&#44; and really seemed to care about what we had been dealing with. She was true to her word in taking care of the matter in a very timely fashion. Have had a few bumps here but over all not bad for the price.
